{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grim Tale of Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knights who returned from their expedition began slaughtering their own people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day the kingdom burned and everything was lost, you were left standing alone in the heart of the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with betrayal and despair, uncover the truth and stand against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/48c59423d170761cbc75597b8f520aa6.poster.avif?t=1762183391\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/48c59423d170761cbc75597b8f520aa6.webm?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/48c59423d170761cbc75597b8f520aa6.mp4?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and Strategic Battles through the Artifact System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Harma\u2019s battles, the power of your cards is determined randomly based on the activation of three artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you can spend Focus to forcefully activate artifacts and take control of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you leave it to chance, or will you risk it all with decisive focus?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice will completely alter the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine two playable characters with over 300 unique cards and artifacts to forge your own deck and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/696f56a2921e08664cb0d9777a21a8f6.poster.avif?t=1762183391\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/696f56a2921e08664cb0d9777a21a8f6.webm?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/696f56a2921e08664cb0d9777a21a8f6.mp4?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harma\u2019s campaign unfolds across four epic acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fall of the world and the fate of Eden firsthand through dynamic battles, branching dialogues, and cinematic cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/a53a449eaff598b6ce39cfe389445b66.poster.avif?t=1762183391\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/a53a449eaff598b6ce39cfe389445b66.webm?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/a53a449eaff598b6ce39cfe389445b66.mp4?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dimensional Rift</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you seek pure combat and strategy beyond the story, challenge yourself in the Dimensional Rift mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this endlessly replayable mode, you will face relentless battles without cinematic storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ever-changing challenges and push your limits to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/5bae24b903f61b150b979d2b22f86bbd.poster.avif?t=1762183391\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/5bae24b903f61b150b979d2b22f86bbd.webm?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/extras/5bae24b903f61b150b979d2b22f86bbd.mp4?t=1762183391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669070?t=1762183391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/e9560912f929f4aa1ebc2ebad7aa6681e00c15bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762183391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/2ccf6ce9bc5aa03243bb254afb050aa7ab979ae0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762183391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669070/2ccf6ce9bc5aa03243bb254afb050aa7ab979ae0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762183391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grim Tale of Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knights who returned from their expedition began slaughtering their own people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day the kingdom burned and everything was lost, you were left standing alone in the heart of the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with betrayal and despair, uncover the truth and stand against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><